   array['Increase the number of goals in a match', 'Shorten the game', 'Stop attackers from waiting near the opponents'' goal for the ball', 'Ban backward passes'],
   'Offside discourages a player from camping behind the last defensive line, forcing the team to build the play.'),
  ('b9351175-d699-570c-b70e-9146c1061428', 'es',
