   array['5', '6', '7', '11'],
   'El baloncesto se juega con cinco jugadores por equipo en la cancha.'),
  ('930a1362-c3b2-5166-ad66-75a780cc255f', 'en',
   'A basket scored from inside the paint, in basketball, is worth:',
   array['1 point', '2 points', '3 points', '4 points'],
   'Shots made inside the three-point line are worth two points.'),
  ('930a1362-c3b2-5166-ad66-75a780cc255f', 'es',
