   array['Shoots from outside the paint', 'Passes the ball backwards', 'Stays more than three seconds in the opponents'' paint', 'Takes more than two steps holding the ball without dribbling'],
   'Holding the ball and not dribbling, a player may take only two steps; beyond that the referee calls travelling.'),
  ('97492d75-a115-5727-888e-3405f39e9c4e', 'es',
