  ('1cfa856a-d65c-5cab-91b4-15d527d939d8', 'en',
   'The fast break, in basketball and handball, mainly aims to:',
   array['Reach the attack before the opposing defence is organised', 'Keep possession until time runs out', 'Force the referees to call fouls', 'Keep every player in their own defensive half'],
   'The fast break exploits the transition: the team moves forward quickly after winning the ball, before the opponents set up their defensive system.'),
  ('1cfa856a-d65c-5cab-91b4-15d527d939d8', 'es',
   'El contraataque, en el baloncesto y el balonmano, busca principalmente:',
   array['Llegar al ataque antes de que la defensa rival se organice', 'Prolongar la posesión hasta que se acabe el tiempo', 'Forzar al arbitraje a señalar faltas', 'Mantener a todos los jugadores en su propia cancha de defensa'],
   'El contraataque aprovecha la transición: el equipo avanza rápido tras recuperar el balón, antes de que el rival arme su sistema defensivo.'),
  ('9f947075-4e7f-5b72-9fa3-5b48bdff408a', 'en',
   'The 6-0 defence in handball is characterised by:',
