   array['Long jump', 'Javelin throw', 'High jump', 'Race walking'],
   'At the 1968 Games Dick Fosbury popularised clearing the bar backwards, which became the standard high jump technique.'),
  ('ab991a5c-ffa5-5096-9ca5-c90689ed718b', 'es',
