   array['Salto de longitud', 'Lanzamiento de jabalina', 'Salto de altura', 'Marcha atlética'],
   'En los Juegos de 1968 Dick Fosbury popularizó el paso del listón de espaldas, que se convirtió en la técnica estándar del salto de altura.'),
  ('bd1827df-ce3d-5ba6-93a3-eb7a8d346498', 'en',
   'The essential difference between race walking and running is that, in race walking:',
   array['Running is allowed over the last few metres', 'Athletes must wear special footwear', 'The event is held only indoors', 'The athlete must keep permanent contact with the ground and the supporting leg straightened'],
