   'The individual medley follows the order butterfly, backstroke, breaststroke and freestyle.'),
  ('547d57f5-41e5-582a-9337-d46f01e1cfda', 'es',
   'En el estilo combinado individual, el orden de los estilos es:',
   array['Libre, braza, espalda y mariposa', 'Braza, mariposa, libre y espalda', 'Espalda, libre, mariposa y braza', 'Mariposa, espalda, braza y libre'],
   'La prueba de estilos individual sigue el orden mariposa, espalda, braza y libre.'),
  ('deb5faf4-fdc9-58ed-b5ab-b0957728a905', 'en',
   'Water polo combines swimming with features of:',
   array['Team invasion sports, with passing, marking and shooting at goal', 'Individual combat sports', 'Artistic gymnastics', 'Open-water endurance events'],
   'Water polo is a team invasion sport played in the water: teams pass, mark and shoot at the opponents'' goal.'),
  ('deb5faf4-fdc9-58ed-b5ab-b0957728a905', 'es',
